{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Follow.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Bullet.png?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the post-apocalyptic world with your friends in search of bunkers, limited to a specific location in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Location-Exploring.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Delve.png?t=1746571790\" />Delve deep into bunkers, scavenging for essential resources, crafting materials, and useful items like the limited selection of flashlights or crowbars found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/DungeonExploring.gif?t=1746571790\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Looting.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Craft.png?t=1746571790\" />Experiment with crafting items using only the available resources, enhancing your survival chances in this isolated location. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Crafting.gif?t=1746571790\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/CraftFirstPerson.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/AvoidTraps.png?t=1746571790\" />Avoid traps with your friends as you navigate the bunker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/AvoidTraps.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Monsters.png?t=1746571790\" /> Stay alert around the demo's limited variety of monsters that emerged after the nuclear apocalypse\u2014or interact with them at your own risk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Interract-with-humster.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/fuel_the_train.png?t=1746571790\" />The train constantly requires fuel\u2014burn items you collect to keep it running, or risk losing everything. Remember, every resource counts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/BurnResources.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/EXTRACTION.png?t=1746571790\" />If your raid goes well, extract your loot safely from the bunker and prepare for another run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Extraction.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/REPEAT_FOR_SURVIVE.png?t=1746571790\" />Repeat these actions in the demo and enjoy endless fun with friends as you work together to survive this challenging location.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215820?t=1746571790","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3215820?t=1746571790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/f351dbfa4935c5317f08ceaad06374986ea4eff3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746571790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/f351dbfa4935c5317f08ceaad06374986ea4eff3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746571790","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3296430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Follow.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Bullet.png?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the post-apocalyptic world with your friends in search of bunkers, limited to a specific location in this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Location-Exploring.gif?t=1746571790\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215820/extras/Delve.png?t=1746571790\" />Delve deep into bunkers, scavenging for essential resources, crafting materials, and useful items like the limited selection of flashlights or crowbars found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"b